<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Steve shot out a TV screen, then stomped over and ground his heels into the toes of Rusty\'92s shoes.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Hey!\'92 Rusty objected. \'91Don\'92t step on my\'97\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Shut up! No one wants to hear about your damn shoes.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Rusty tossed Valerie\'92s legs off his lap and shot up on his feet, spoiling for a fight.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Boys! Boys! Boys!\'92 Tony shouted. \'91Is this where we\'92re goin\'92 back to? Biffing over song lyrics?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>A sombre atmosphere descended. All the male Elvi pulled their chins in and looked down with shame at their suede shoes.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Steve pat Tony on the shoulder. \'91Hey, Great Teacher. It\'92ll be all right. You always come through in a pinch. We can always beat you up again if you need the incentive.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Tony shrank away from Steve. \'91Nah, thanks. I appreciate the offer. Just give me the day. OK?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>They gave the Great Teacher the day. The results weren\'92t good.
